  m_text: 'Sir,


    Finance has our recent budget report. We need to set an appoinment
    to meet and this cannot wait. I have personally talked with your assistant about
    this matter to get it on your schedule. All we need is for you to show up.


    Thank
    you,

    Armond Ponte

    Finance Department'
